sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Your code
    participant S as typesafe-sdk
    participant A as TypeSafe API (Jev)
    C->>S: jev.system_one(state, questions, model)
    S->>S: check questions (criteria present)
    S->>A: POST /v1/systemone, Bearer key
    opt error 408, 429 or 5xx
        A-->>S: error status
        S->>A: retry, up to 2 times, 30 s budget
    end
    Note over A: Jev reads the state<br/>one typed answer per question
    A-->>S: JSON: model, answers, usage
    S-->>C: SystemOneResponse
    C->>C: if / else on answers
